 {'id':'C02','classification':'CONFIRMED','claim':'2DCONV CH/DH is 3.347255x despite only 0.767% lower L2 read payload and identical DRAM read payload; traffic volume reduction alone is insufficient as an explanation.','evidence':['2DCONV traffic','2DCONV cycles']},
